    "firstPrototypeCorrections": "Iteration1a was rejected during actual asset review because parallel thin lamellae read as hanging strips. Iteration1b corrected only the infestation with fewer rooted volumes. Iteration1c corrects a measured backing-plate occlusion bug on the single maintenance cover: shallow protective bars remain in front of their backing and the existing coolant tank, with the original14mm maximum lip and no new collision. Character1b remains byte-identical in1c. These are first-gate corrections, not approval to expand the pass.",
    "firstGate2Authorization": "Parent explicitly requested one coherent first-gate revision after the five actual1c game views: replace cloth/plant-like decorative growth and clean suit with targeted broken negative space, dark layered wound/root integration and local dried contact residue. Repair only the same maintenance cover to one torn corner, three unequal broken rods, failed fastener, one snagged frayed strip and a single irregular interrupted heel/tool rub with one dried handwipe. No new generation, no additional clusters, no lighting/scale/camera changes. Stop after the same actual2.46m/3.40m/4m and maintenance views for the next creative decision.",
